=head1 DESCRIPTION

This object defines one key that will be added with the addKeys
(https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/logs/CloudWatch-Logs-Transformation.html#CloudWatch-Logs-Transformation-addKey)
processor.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Key => Str

The key of the new entry to be added to the log event


=head2 OverwriteIfExists => Bool

Specifies whether to overwrite the value if the key already exists in
the log event. If you omit this, the default is C<false>.


=head2 B<REQUIRED> Value => Str

The value of the new entry to be added to the log event



